  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : $16 \\mathrm{p}$ means $\\mathrm{z}=16$\n$18 \\mathrm{e}^{-}$means, 2 unit negative charge is present.\nHence species is $\\mathrm{S}^{-2}$",
